melody:
'Tis the gift to be sim-ple, 'tis the gift to be free,
D4/ D4/ G4 G4/ A4/ B4/ G4/ B4/ C5/ D5 D5/ C5/ B4
'tis the gift to come down where we ought to be;
A4/ G4/ A4 A4 A4 G4 A4/ B4/ A4/ F#4/ D4
and when we find our-selves in the place just right,
D4 G4/ F#4/ G4/ A4/ B4/ ~A4/ B4/ C5/ D5 D5/ ~C5/ B4
'twill be in the val-ley of love and de-light.
A4/ G4/ A4 A4 B4 B4/ A4/ G4 G4/ G4/ G4(2)
When true sim-plic-i-ty is gained,
D5(2) B4. A4/ B4/ C5/ B4/ A4/ G4.
to bow and to bend we shan't be a-shamed;
A4/ B4 B4/ C5/ D5 C5/ ~B4/ A4 A4/ B4/ A4
to turn, turn will be our de-light,
D4 G4(2) G4. A4/ B4 B4/ C5/ D5
till by turn-ing, turn-ing we come round right.
C5/ B4/ A4 A4 B4 B4/ A4/ G4 G4 G4 r
